[[Chest of Plants]] is a reward for [[daily]] forager achievements.

== Acquisition ==
{{achievement list|reward=Chest of Plants|expandable=y}}

== Contents ==
* 8 plant drops, in the following categories (the same entry may drop twice):
** 2 random vegetable drops
*** {{contains|Head of Cabbage|qty=1-3}}
*** {{contains|Head of Lettuce|qty=1-3}}
*** {{contains|Kale Leaf|qty=1-3}}
*** {{contains|Mushroom|qty=1-4}}
*** {{contains|Spinach Leaf|qty=1-4}}
*** {{contains|Zucchini|qty=1-3}}
** 2 random root vegetable drop
*** {{contains|Beet|qty=1-3}}
*** {{contains|Carrot|qty=1-3}}
*** {{contains|Onion|qty=1-3}}
*** {{contains|Potato|qty=1-4}}
*** {{contains|Turnip|qty=1-3}}
*** {{contains|Yam|qty=1-3}}
** 2 random herb drops
*** {{contains|Bay Leaf|qty=1-3}}
*** {{contains|Black Peppercorn|qty=1-3}}
*** {{contains|Chili Pepper|qty=1-3}}
*** {{contains|Dill Sprig|qty=1-3}}
*** {{contains|Head of Garlic|qty=1-4}}
*** {{contains|Oregano Leaf|qty=1-3}}
*** {{contains|Parsley Leaf|qty=1-?}}
